        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect Diamond is a fast-paced puzzle game created for the original NES from the 1980s. Slide puzzle blocks into the grid to fill lines. Play any of the 3 single-player game modes, or battle a friend or CPU in local multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ROM file included for those who want to play on emulator or on a real NES via flash cart. (Right-click the game in your Steam library, click Properties/Installed Files/Browse)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanics:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pieces slide forward on their own. You can move them right or left, and spin them in either direction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a piece reaches a position where it fits, it drops into the grid.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a piece passes the grid without dropping into it, it is discarded and comes back 2 pieces later. If the same piece passes the grid a second time, it's game over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a line in either diagonal is filled, it is cleared and points are awarded.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional points are awarded for clearing multiple lines simultaneously, clearing lines in both diagonals simultaneously, and fitting a piece snugly into a hole.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single Player Game Modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival: Try to score as many points as you can while the speed increases ever 11 lines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prudence: Take it slow and get as many points as you can with 250 pieces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Velocity: Disregard score, clear 50 lines as fast as possible!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer Game Modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blocks: Score points to send blocks to mess up your opponent's grid.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed: Clear 11 lines to increase your opponent's speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both: Enable Blocks and Speed together.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect Diamond is a fast-paced puzzle game created for the original NES from the 1980s. Slide puzzle blocks into the grid to fill lines. Play any of the 3 single-player game modes, or battle a friend or CPU in local multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ROM file included for those who want to play on emulator or on a real NES via flash cart. (Right-click the game in your Steam library, click Properties/Installed Files/Browse)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanics:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pieces slide forward on their own. You can move them right or left, and spin them in either direction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a piece reaches a position where it fits, it drops into the grid.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a piece passes the grid without dropping into it, it is discarded and comes back 2 pieces later. If the same piece passes the grid a second time, it's game over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a line in either diagonal is filled, it is cleared and points are awarded.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional points are awarded for clearing multiple lines simultaneously, clearing lines in both diagonals simultaneously, and fitting a piece snugly into a hole.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single Player Game Modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival: Try to score as many points as you can while the speed increases ever 11 lines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prudence: Take it slow and get as many points as you can with 250 pieces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Velocity: Disregard score, clear 50 lines as fast as possible!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer Game Modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blocks: Score points to send blocks to mess up your opponent's grid.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed: Clear 11 lines to increase your opponent's speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both: Enable Blocks and Speed together.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Perfect Diamond is a fast-paced puzzle game made for the NES. ROM included! Slide puzzle blocks into the grid to fill lines. Try to survive as the pieces move faster and faster. 3 single-player modes, local multiplayer battle, battle vs CPU.",
